{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-orchard-toys-jungle-heads-and-tails-2512-0256","content_id":"3c4fadba-4b00-45ea-9d80-d4232a0cae36","description":"Product Recall for Orchard Toys Jungle Heads & Tails presenting a serious risk of choking.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"9114b926-b005-46db-a2bd-21ddc70b1f84","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-12-23T13:16:29+00:00","id":"9114b926-b005-46db-a2bd-21ddc70b1f84","title":"Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-12-23T13:16:29+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/694a962d3022cdf03a0eb902/2512-0256-product-recall-orchard-toys-jungle-heads-and-tails.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Orchard Toys Jungle Heads &amp; Tails</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of choking as small parts are easily accessible.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys – Card Games (Non-Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Orchard Toys</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>0000</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Batch codes</td>\n      <td>SP/001639/058/17.03.25</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Reference/Code</td>\n      <td>058</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Set of 24 cards and an elephant playing piece.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_9114b926-b005-46db-a2bd-21ddc70b1f84\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/694a962d3022cdf03a0eb902/2512-0256-product-recall-orchard-toys-jungle-heads-and-tails.pdf\">Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of choking as the elephant has a cardboard disc which should have been removed from the nose as part of the manufacturing process. This disc is a small part. Small parts pose a choking hazard to young children, particularly those under 36 months of age who have a natural tendency to explore objects by placing them in their mouths.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<p>Consumers are advised to stop using the product immediately and keep it out of reach of small children. Return the product to the distributor or to Orchard Toys for redress.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2512-0256</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-23T10:32:54Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-12-23","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-12-23T10:32:54+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-orchard-toys-jungle-heads-and-tails-2